{"ref":"BDB, אָלָה","hw":"אָלָה","html":"† II. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָלָה</span></big></big>  vb. <strong>swear, curse (</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אלה\" href=\"/BDB,_אלה\", dir=\"rtl\">I. אלה</a>? so Thes Lag<sup>Or ii. 3</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.31\">1 K 8:31</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.22\">2 Ch 6:22</a> all Vrss Th Bö Bä Kp reading <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאָלָה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אָלִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:2\" href=\"/Judges.17.2\">Ju 17:2</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָלֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:2\" href=\"/Hosea.4.2\">Ho 4:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:4\" href=\"/Hosea.10.4\">Ho 10:4</a>. <strong>1.</strong>  <em>swear, take oath</em> before God <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.31\">1 K 8:31</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.22\">2 Ch 6:22</a>); in covenants <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:2\" href=\"/Hosea.4.2\">Ho 4:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:4\" href=\"/Hosea.10.4\">10:4</a> (falsely). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>curse</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:2\" href=\"/Judges.17.2\">Ju 17:2</a>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֹּ֫אֶ֗ל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.24\">1 S 14:24</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַאֲלֹתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.31\">1 K 8:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.22\">2 Ch 6:22</a> <em>adjure, put under oath</em>.","next":"BDB, אָלָה²","prev":"BDB, אֶלְקָנָה"}